WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.500
In Hangzhou, the West Lake is where hills meet the city.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.000
Mist over the water at dawn — a World Heritage site.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.000
Broken Bridge, where the legend begins.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Tea picking in the hills of Longjing.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Hangzhou awaits you.
